<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Halley — 부동산 매물 비교</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@300;500;700&family=Noto+Sans+KR:wght@300;400;500;700&family=Noto+Sans:wght@400;600;700&family=JetBrains+Mono:wght@500;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/app.css">
    <script defer src="/js/app.js"></script>
    <script defer src="/js/vendor/alpine.min.js"></script>
    <!-- 카카오(다음) 우편번호 서비스 — 주소 검색 팝업 -->
    <script src="https://t1.daumcdn.net/mapjsapi/bundle/postcode/prod/postcode.v2.js"></script>
    {{#kakaoJsKey}}
    <script src="https://dapi.kakao.com/v2/maps/sdk.js?appkey={{kakaoJsKey}}&autoload=false"></script>
    {{/kakaoJsKey}}
</head>
<body x-data="halley()" x-init="init()">

<div class="shell">
    <div class="topbar">
        <div class="topbar-in">
            <a class="wordmark" href="/">Halley</a>
            <template x-if="session.authenticated">
                <nav class="nav">
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='list'}" @click="setView('list')">매물</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='itinerary'}" @click="setView('itinerary')">임장</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='me'}" @click="setView('me')">프로필</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: view==='weights'}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="setView('weights')">기준</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: showUsers}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="openUsers()">사용자</button>
                    <button class="nav-btn" :class="{on: showSettings}" x-show="session.role==='ADMIN'" @click="openSettings()">설정</button>
                    <span class="who"><b x-text="session.nickname"></b><span x-text="session.role==='ADMIN' ? ' · 관리자' : ''"></span></span>
                    <button class="btn btn-ghost" @click="logout()">로그아웃</button>
                </nav>
            </template>
        </div>
    </div>

    <main class="main-grid" :class="mobileTab">
        <div class="mobile-tabs">
            <button :class="{on: mobileTab==='map'}" @click="setMobileTab('map')">지도</button>
            <button :class="{on: mobileTab==='list'}" @click="setMobileTab('list')">리스트</button>
        </div>
        <section class="map-panel">
            <div id="map" class="map-canvas"></div>
            <div class="map-empty" x-show="!session.authenticated || session.mustChangePassword">
                <div class="empty-ic">◌</div>
                <h4>카카오맵 대기 중</h4>
                <p>로그인 후 매물 좌표가 마커로 표시됩니다.</p>
            </div>
        </section>

        <aside class="list-panel">
            <template x-if="session.authenticated && !session.mustChangePassword">
                <div>
                    <div x-show="view==='list'">
                        <div class="sec-head sec-head-actions">
                            <span class="sec-num">01</span><h2>매물</h2>
                            <span class="sec-sub" x-text="visibleProperties.length + '건'"></span>
                            <div class="sec-actions">
                                <button class="btn btn-sm" @click="openCompare()"
                                        :disabled="!canCompare()" :title="compareHint()">비교 우위 분석</button>
                                <button class="btn btn-primary btn-sm" @click="openAddMenu()">+ 매물 추가</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        <div class="deal-tabs">
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='ALL'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('ALL')">전체</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='SALE'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('SALE')">매매</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='JEONSE'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('JEONSE')">전세</button>
                            <button :class="{on: dealTypeFilter==='MONTHLY'}" @click="setDealTypeFilter('MONTHLY')">월세</button>
                            <button class="sold-toggle" :class="{on: showSoldOut}" @click="toggleSoldOut()">판매완료 포함</button>
                        </div>
                        <div class="property-list">
                            <template x-if="visibleProperties.length === 0">
                                <div class="empty">
                                    <div class="empty-ic">◌</div>
                                    <h4>아직 등록된 매물이 없습니다</h4>
                                    <p>네이버 매물 상세 텍스트를 붙여넣거나 직접 입력해 첫 매물을 등록해 보세요.</p>
                                    <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="openAddMenu()">+ 매물 추가</button>
                                </div>
                            </template>
                            <template x-for="r in visibleProperties" :key="r.property.id">
                                <article class="property-card" :class="{active: activePropertyId === r.property.id, sold: r.property.listingStatus==='SOLD_OUT'}"
                                         :id="'prop-' + r.property.id" @click="focusProperty(r)">
                                    <div class="property-card-header">
                                        <span class="property-card-name" x-text="r.property.name"></span>
                                        <span class="owner-badge" x-show="r.property.createdByNickname"
                                              :title="'등록: ' + r.property.createdByNickname">
                                            <i class="owner-initial" x-text="ownerInitial(r.property.createdByNickname)"></i>
                                            <span x-text="r.property.createdByNickname"></span>
                                        </span>
                                        <span class="property-card-price" x-text="fmtWon(r.property.priceDeposit)"></span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="property-card-meta">
                                        <span class="badge" :class="dealBadge(r.property.dealType)" x-text="dealLabel(r.property.dealType)"></span>
                                        <span class="badge b-admin" x-show="r.property.isDraft">작성 중</span>
                                        <span class="badge b-off" x-show="r.property.listingStatus==='SOLD_OUT'">판매완료</span>
                                        <span x-text="r.property.addressRoad"></span>
                                        <span x-show="r.property.floorNo" x-text="r.property.floorNo + '층'"></span>
                                        <span x-show="r.property.areaSupplyM2" x-text="'공급 ' + fmtArea(r.property.areaSupplyM2)"></span>
                                        <span x-show="r.property.areaExclusiveM2" x-text="'전용 ' + fmtArea(r.property.areaExclusiveM2)"></span>
                                        <span class="score-pill" :class="r.totalScore != null && r.totalScore >= 50 ? 'score-high' : 'score-low'">
                                            <b x-text="fmtScore(r.totalScore)"></b><i>점</i>
                                        </span>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="property-card-actions" @click.stop>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openDetail(r)">상세</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" x-show="r.property.isDraft" @click="openPasteModal(r)">완성</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openCheckLogs(r)">이력</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openComments(r)">코멘트</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openScoreModal(r)">채점</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openLoanModal(r)">대출</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openRefModal(r)">실거래</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link" @click="openEditProperty(r)">수정</button>
                                        <button class="btn-link danger" @click="removeProperty(r)">삭제</button>
                                    </div>
                                </article>
                            </template>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='weights'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">03</span><h2>평가 기준·가중치</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="weights.length + '개'"></span></div>
                        <div class="card table-wrap">
                            <table>
                                <thead>
                                <tr><th>순위</th><th>기준</th><th>유형</th><th>가중치</th><th>이동</th></tr>
                                </thead>
                                <tbody>
                                <template x-for="(w, i) in weights" :key="w.criterionCode">
                                    <tr draggable="true" @dragstart="dragStartWeight(i)" @dragover.prevent="dragOverWeight(i)"
                                        @dragend="dragEndWeight()" :class="{dragging: _dragIndex === i}">
                                        <td class="num drag-handle" x-text="i + 1"></td>
                                        <td class="strong" x-text="w.name"></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <span class="badge" :class="w.scoringType==='AUTO' ? 'b-mem' : (w.scoringType==='HYBRID' ? 'b-jeonse' : 'b-admin')"
                                                  x-text="w.scoringType==='AUTO' ? '자동' : (w.scoringType==='HYBRID' ? '추정' : '수동')"></span>
                                        </td>
                                        <td class="num" x-text="w.weight"></td>
                                        <td>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="moveWeight(i, -1)" :disabled="i === 0">↑</button>
                                            <button class="btn-link" @click="moveWeight(i, 1)" :disabled="i === weights.length - 1">↓</button>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                </template>
                                </tbody>
                            </table>
                        </div>
                        <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                        <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="saveWeights()" :disabled="loading">
                            <span x-text="loading ? '저장 중…' : '가중치 저장'"></span>
                        </button>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='itinerary'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">05</span><h2>임장 플래너</h2><span class="sec-sub" x-text="itinProperties.length + '건 선택'"></span></div>
                        <div class="card itin-panel">
                            <div class="form-grid">
                                <label class="span2">출발지 주소
                                    <div class="workplace-search">
                                        <input type="text" x-model="itinStart.address" placeholder="주소 검색 버튼을 눌러 선택하세요" readonly>
                                        <button class="btn" type="button" @click="searchPostcodeFor('itinerary')">주소 검색</button>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <label>위도
                                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="itinStart.lat" readonly placeholder="주소 선택 시 자동 입력">
                                </label>
                                <label>경도
                                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="itinStart.lng" readonly placeholder="주소 선택 시 자동 입력">
                                </label>
                                <label>이동수단
                                    <select x-model="itinMode">
                                        <option value="DRIVING">자가용</option>
                                        <option value="TRANSIT">대중교통</option>
                                    </select>
                                </label>
                                <label>시작시간
                                    <input type="time" x-model="itinWindowStart">
                                </label>
                                <label>체류(분)
                                    <input type="number" min="5" x-model="itinStay">
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <div class="itin-props">
                                <template x-for="r in visibleProperties" :key="r.property.id">
                                    <label class="itin-check">
                                        <input type="checkbox" :checked="itinProperties.includes(r.property.id)"
                                               @change="toggleItineraryProperty(r.property.id)">
                                        <span x-text="r.property.name"></span>
                                        <small x-text="fmtWon(r.property.priceDeposit)"></small>
                                    </label>
                                </template>
                            </div>
                            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                            <div class="paste-actions">
                                <button class="btn" @click="optimizeItinerary()" :disabled="loading">경로 계산</button>
                                <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="savePlan()" :disabled="loading" x-show="itinResult && !itinPlan">계획 저장</button>
                                <button class="btn" @click="recomputePlan()" :disabled="loading" x-show="itinPlan">재계산</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>

                        <template x-if="itinResult && !itinPlan">
                            <div class="itin-result card">
                                <p class="itin-total">예상 이동시간 합계: <b x-text="itinResult.totalMinutes + '분'"></b></p>
                                <template x-for="(id, i) in itinResult.orderedPropertyIds" :key="id">
                                    <div class="itin-stop">
                                        <span class="itin-num" x-text="i + 1"></span>
                                        <span x-text="propertyName(id)"></span>
                                    </div>
                                </template>
                            </div>
                        </template>

                        <template x-if="itinPlan">
                            <div class="itin-result card">
                                <p class="itin-total">총 이동 <b x-text="(itinPlan?.totalMinutes ?? 0) + '분'"></b> · <b x-text="(itinPlan?.stops?.length ?? 0) + '곳'"></b></p>
                                <template x-for="s in (itinPlan?.stops || [])" :key="s.id">
                                    <label class="itin-stop" :class="{done: s.visited}">
                                        <span class="itin-num" x-text="s.stopOrder + 1"></span>
                                        <span class="itin-time" x-text="s.estimatedArrival"></span>
                                        <span x-text="propertyName(s.propertyId)"></span>
                                        <small x-text="s.travelMinutesFromPrev ? '이동 ' + s.travelMinutesFromPrev + '분' : '출발'"></small>
                                        <input type="checkbox" :checked="s.visited" @change="toggleItineraryStop(s.id, !s.visited)">
                                    </label>
                                </template>
                            </div>
                        </template>
                    </div>

                    <div x-show="view==='me'">
                        <div class="sec-head"><span class="sec-num">06</span><h2>내 프로필</h2></div>
                        <template x-if="profile">
                            <div class="card profile-panel">
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>아이디</span><b x-text="profile.loginId"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>닉네임</span><b x-text="profile.nickname"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>이메일</span><b x-text="profile.email"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>역할</span><b x-text="profile.role === 'ADMIN' ? '관리자' : '회원'"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>보유 현금</span><b x-text="fmtWon(profile.availableBudget)"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>연소득</span><b x-text="fmtWon(profile.annualIncome)"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>기존 대출액</span><b x-text="fmtWon(profile.existingLoan)"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>직장</span><b x-text="profile.workplaceName || '미설정'"></b></div>
                                <div class="profile-row"><span>직장 좌표</span><b x-text="(profile.workplaceLat != null ? profile.workplaceLat + ', ' + profile.workplaceLng : '미설정')"></b></div>
                            </div>
                        </template>
                        <template x-if="profile">
                        <div class="card profile-panel" style="margin-top:14px;">
                            <h4 class="profile-title">프로필 수정</h4>
                            <div class="form-grid">
                                <label>닉네임
                                    <input type="text" x-model="profileForm.nickname" placeholder="리스트·의견에 표시되는 이름">
                                </label>
                                <label>이메일
                                    <input type="email" x-model="profileForm.email" placeholder="name@example.com">
                                </label>
                                <label class="span2">직장 주소
                                    <div class="workplace-search">
                                        <input type="text" x-model="profileForm.workplaceName" placeholder="주소 검색 버튼을 눌러 선택하세요" readonly>
                                        <button class="btn" type="button" @click="searchPostcodeFor('profile')">주소 검색</button>
                                    </div>
                                </label>
                                <label>위도
                                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="profileForm.workplaceLat" readonly placeholder="주소 선택 시 자동 입력">
                                </label>
                                <label>경도
                                    <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="profileForm.workplaceLng" readonly placeholder="주소 선택 시 자동 입력">
                                </label>
                                <label class="span2">보유 현금 (원)
                                    <input type="number" min="1" x-model="profileForm.availableBudget" placeholder="300000000">
                                    <span class="settings-note">대출을 뺀 동원 가능한 현금입니다. 바꾸면 전 매물의 가격 점수가 다시 계산됩니다.</span>
                                </label>
                                <label>연소득 (원)
                                    <input type="number" min="1" x-model="profileForm.annualIncome" placeholder="50000000">
                                    <span class="settings-note">세전 기준. 대출 한도(DSR) 계산에 씁니다.</span>
                                </label>
                                <label>기존 대출액 (원)
                                    <input type="number" min="0" x-model="profileForm.existingLoan" placeholder="0">
                                    <span class="settings-note">없으면 0. 있으면 그만큼 DSR 여력에서 빠집니다.</span>
                                </label>
                            </div>
                            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
                            <div class="panel-actions">
                                <button class="btn btn-primary" @click="saveProfile()" :disabled="loading">
                                    <span x-text="loading ? '저장 중…' : '프로필 저장'"></span>
                                </button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                        </template>
                        <div class="card profile-panel" style="margin-top:14px;">
                            <h4 class="profile-title">비밀번호 변경</h4>
                            <div class="panel-actions">
                                <button class="btn" @click="openChangePw()">비밀번호 변경</button>
                            </div>
                        </div>
                    </div>

                </div>
            </template>
        </aside>
    </main>
</div>

<!-- D1 로그인 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showLogin" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="modal-card modal-login">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">우리들끼리 부동산 매물 비교 🏡</span>
            <h3>Halley</h3>
            <p>계정 정보를 입력해 들어오세요.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="form" @submit.prevent="login()">
            <label>ID
                <input type="text" x-model="loginForm.loginId" autocomplete="username" placeholder="admin" required
                       x-ref="loginId" x-effect="if (showLogin) $nextTick(() => $refs.loginId.focus())">
            </label>
            <label>Password
                <input type="password" x-model="loginForm.password" autocomplete="current-password" placeholder="••••••••" required>
            </label>
            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit" :disabled="loading">
                <span x-text="loading ? '로그인 중…' : '로그인'"></span>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D2 비밀번호 강제 변경 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showPassword" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="modal-card">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">보안</span>
            <h3>비밀번호 변경</h3>
            <p>최초 로그인 또는 임시 비밀번호로 접속하셨습니다. 새 비밀번호를 설정해야 계속할 수 있습니다.</p>
        </div>
        <form class="form" @submit.prevent="changePassword()">
            <label>현재 비밀번호
                <input type="password" x-model="passwordForm.currentPassword" autocomplete="current-password" required>
            </label>
            <label>새 비밀번호
                <input type="password" x-model="passwordForm.newPassword" autocomplete="new-password" minlength="8" required>
            </label>
            <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
            <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit" :disabled="loading">
                <span x-text="loading ? '변경 중…' : '비밀번호 변경'"></span>
            </button>
        </form>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D2-2 최초 프로필 설정 (강제 — 설계 6.1 · I48) -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showProfileSetup" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop"></div>
    <div class="modal-card modal-wide">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">최초 설정</span>
            <h3>프로필을 완성해 주세요</h3>
            <p>직장 위치와 보유 현금이 있어야 <b>직주근접</b>과 <b>가격</b> 항목이 채점됩니다. 연소득은 <b>대출 한도</b>를 매물마다 바로 보여주는 데 씁니다.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="form-grid">
            <label class="span2">이메일
                <input type="email" x-model="setupForm.email" placeholder="name@example.com">
                <span class="settings-note">로그인 아이디와 별개인 연락처입니다.</span>
            </label>
            <label class="span2">직장 주소
                <div class="workplace-search">
                    <input type="text" x-model="setupForm.workplaceName" placeholder="주소 검색 버튼을 눌러 선택하세요" readonly>
                    <button class="btn" type="button" @click="searchPostcodeFor('setup')">주소 검색</button>
                </div>
            </label>
            <label>위도
                <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="setupForm.workplaceLat" readonly placeholder="주소 선택 시 자동 입력">
            </label>
            <label>경도
                <input type="number" step="0.000001" x-model="setupForm.workplaceLng" readonly placeholder="주소 선택 시 자동 입력">
            </label>
            <label class="span2">보유 현금 (원)
                <input type="number" min="1" x-model="setupForm.availableBudget" placeholder="300000000">
                <span class="settings-note">대출을 뺀 <b>동원 가능한 현금</b>입니다. 활성 사용자 전원의 합계가 가격 채점의 예산 상한이 됩니다.</span>
            </label>
            <label>연소득 (원)
                <input type="number" min="1" x-model="setupForm.annualIncome" placeholder="50000000">
                <span class="settings-note">세전 기준. 대출 한도(DSR) 계산에 씁니다.</span>
            </label>
            <label>기존 대출액 (원)
                <input type="number" min="0" x-model="setupForm.existingLoan" placeholder="0">
                <span class="settings-note">없으면 0으로 두세요.</span>
            </label>
        </div>
        <p class="form-error" x-show="error" x-text="error"></p>
        <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" @click="saveProfileSetup()" :disabled="loading">
            <span x-text="loading ? '저장 중…' : '저장하고 시작하기'"></span>
        </button>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- D8 등록 방식 선택 모달 -->
<div class="modal" x-show="showAddMenu" x-cloak>
    <div class="modal-backdrop" @click="closeAddMenu()"></div>
    <div class="modal-card">
        <div class="modal-head">
            <span class="modal-kicker">매물 등록</span>
            <h3>등록 방식 선택</h3>
            <p>네이버 매물 상세 텍스트를 붙여넣거나 직접 입력하세요.</p>
